<main class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-5xl flex-col gap-8 px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 md:py-14">
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-emerald-200/15 bg-slate-900/85 p-6 shadow-2xl shadow-emerald-900/30 backdrop-blur sm:p-10">
    <div class="absolute -top-24 -left-16 h-52 w-52 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute -right-20 -bottom-20 h-48 w-48 rounded-full bg-yellow-400/20 blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="relative z-10">
      <p class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-emerald-300/30 bg-emerald-300/10 px-4 py-1 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-emerald-100">
        Pray smarter. Stay consistent.
      </p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">Prayer Streak</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base text-emerald-100 sm:text-lg">
        Bangun Konsistensi Salat dengan Streak, XP, dan Achievement
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-sm text-slate-200 sm:text-base">
        Aplikasi awal ini menyiapkan fondasi Express.js + EJS + Tailwind CSS + Prisma + MySQL supaya kamu bisa
        mulai membangun tracker kebiasaan salat dengan arsitektur yang bersih dan siap dikembangkan.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <span class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-amber-500/15 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-amber-100">
          Setup awal berhasil
        </span>
        <a href="/register" class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-emerald-400 px-5 py-2 font-semibold text-slate-900 transition hover:bg-amber-300">
          Mulai Tracking
        </a>
        <a href="/login" class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-emerald-200/40 px-5 py-2 font-semibold text-emerald-100 transition hover:bg-white/5">
          Login
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
    <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-700/70 bg-slate-900/85 p-5 shadow-lg">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-200">Express.js</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300">Framework backend utama dengan routing ringan dan cepat untuk memulai API maupun halaman web.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-700/70 bg-slate-900/85 p-5 shadow-lg">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-200">EJS</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300">Template engine server-side yang simpel untuk render halaman dan komponen partial secara rapi.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-700/70 bg-slate-900/85 p-5 shadow-lg">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-200">Tailwind CSS</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300">Utility-first styling untuk antarmuka yang cepat dibangun, konsisten, dan responsive.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-700/70 bg-slate-900/85 p-5 shadow-lg">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-200">Prisma</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300">ORM modern yang siap untuk manajemen skema database dan migration ke MySQL.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-700/70 bg-slate-900/85 p-5 shadow-lg sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-200">MySQL</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300">Database relational stabil untuk menyimpan data salat dan progres habit di masa depan.</p>
    </article>
  </section>
</main>
